<title>POLAND: POLISH SHARES CLOSE MIXED IN CONTINUOUS TRADE.</title>
<headline>POLISH SHARES CLOSE MIXED IN CONTINUOUS TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six stocks rose, four fell and five were flat in 26.1-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continous trade on Thursday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,608.1 points, 0.4 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining eight stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.3 percent in a 6.4-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
